      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Well there is one issue with this system, there ranking system in place as of now for avatar performance would make that system seem like it's broken because, there will be avatars that will have 1 or 2 dynamic bone scripts and not that many bones on it and immediately, they get blocked, another would be to many animators for avatars that have animations that they show off to friends, and regarding animators and animations, someone could easily take an avatar and use an emote toggle to have their avatar disabled during upload since the SKD only looks at \"Active Object inScene\" and when uploaded it will be a \"Perfect\" avatar and then they can toggle it on and boom, 1000 dynamics, and more than enough mesh renderers, too many particles, crappy shaders, etc...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
